<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Home | TLMPS Academic Portal</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --purple: #3b1c56;
            --purple-light: #5c2d91;
            --lilac: #f4f0fa;
            --green: #84cc16;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --border: #e7ddf3;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: var(--text);
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 8% 5%, #e1d5f6 0, transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 95% 95%, #e7f8c8 0, transparent 28%), var(--lilac);
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .shell { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 0 44px; }
        .header {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;
            padding: 18px 24px; color: white; background: var(--purple);
            border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 0 16px 35px #3b1c5630;
        }
        .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
        .brand img { width: 58px; height: 58px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 50%; background: white; }
        .brand h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 26px); }
        .brand p { margin: 5px 0 0; color: #ddd0f2; font-size: 13px; }
        .login-link { color: var(--purple); background: var(--green); border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 16px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
        .intro { padding: 44px 4px 24px; }
        .intro h2 { margin: 0 0 9px; color: var(--purple); font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px); }
        .intro p { max-width: 650px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .section-label { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--purple); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
        .card {
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 215px; padding: 22px;
            color: inherit; background: rgba(255,255,255,.94); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px #3b1c560d;
            transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
        }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 16px 30px #3b1c5620; }
        .icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--purple); background: #eee6fa; border-radius: 13px; }
        .icon svg { width: 25px; height: 25px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-width: 1.8; }
        .card h3 { margin: 20px 0 8px; color: var(--purple); font-size: 18px; }
        .card p { flex: 1; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; }
        .open { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--purple-light); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
        footer { padding-top: 34px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
        @media (max-width: 820px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .shell { width: min(100% - 24px, 500px); padding-top: 12px; }
            .header { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
            .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .card { min-height: 180px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="shell">
        <header class="header">
            <div class="brand">
                <img src="/img/tlmps_llogo_compressed_no_bg.png" alt="TLMPS logo">
                <div>
                    <h1>TLMPS Academic Portal</h1>
                    <p>The Leaders Memorial Private School</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <a class="login-link" href="/login">Student Login</a>
        </header>

        <section class="intro">
            <h2>Welcome Home</h2>
            <p>Choose the portal you need. Each quick link takes you directly to the right workspace for students, teachers, administrators, and school management.</p>
        </section>

        <p class="section-label">Quick links</p>
        <section class="grid" aria-label="Portal quick links">
            <a class="card" href="/login">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 20v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="3"/><path d="m17 11 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Student Portal</h3><p>Students can sign in to view their dashboard, profile, results, and academic performance.</p><span class="open">Open student login</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="/teacher/login">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2Z"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Teacher Portal</h3><p>Teachers can enter, update, and review scores for their assigned subjects and terms.</p><span class="open">Open teacher login</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="/classteacher/dashboard">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M3 9h18M8 13h.01M12 13h.01M16 13h.01M8 17h.01M12 17h.01"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Class Teacher Remarks</h3><p>Class teachers can manage remarks, attendance information, and class-level records.</p><span class="open">Open class teacher dashboard</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="/admin/login">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Subject Admin</h3><p>Subject administrators can access the score management workspace and subject records.</p><span class="open">Open subject admin</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="/superadmin/login">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 4 7v5c0 4.5 3.4 7.8 8 9 4.6-1.2 8-4.5 8-9V7l-8-4Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Superadmin Control</h3><p>Manage students, registrations, academic sessions, subjects, and school-wide settings.</p><span class="open">Open superadmin login</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="/superadmin/sessions">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18M8 14h3M8 17h6"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Academic Sessions</h3><p>Access session workspaces for terms, student enrollment, promotion, and registration.</p><span class="open">Open session workspace</span>
            </a>
            <a class="card" href="/superadmin/analytics">
                <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16"/><path d="m7 15 3-4 3 2 5-7"/></svg></span>
                <h3>Data Analytics &amp; Report Cards</h3><p>Review school performance and view or download report cards by session, term, class, and student.</p><span class="open">Open analytics workspace</span>
            </a>
        </section>
        <footer>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> The Leaders Memorial Private School</footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
